  "reason": "Existing evidence shows scvi_n200 (config_004) outperforms pca_n2000 and scgpt in singleprofile RNA-only settings, while scgpt underperforms in multiprofile configurations (config_008). This experiment tests scgpt in singleprofile settings to isolate whether its poor performance stems from the profile setting or the encoder itself. It directly compares scgpt against the established scvi_n200 baseline, clarifying the encoder's effectiveness in singleprofile scenarios. This addresses uncertainty about scgpt's viability and informs future multimodal or multiprofile experiments."
}

